      "fontSize": 20,
      "fontFamily": 3,
      "text": "// Post comment\nPOST /comments/:videoid\nheaders {JWT}\nbody {text}\n-> Comment\n\n// Get Historical Comments (on livestream join)\nGET /comments/:videoid?cursor={last_comment_timestamp}&pageSize=10\n-> List<Comment>\n\n// Live Comments\nSSE (Server Sent Events)\n-> Receive Comment",
